{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"The prior shallow-history, filter-limit, empty-tree, configuration-precedence, lazy-fetch, and corrupt-graph findings remain unresolved in this checkout. I’m checking the surrounding doctor and fix flow for additional defects and comparing the tests with those cases."}}
