{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"pose suggest review --path pose-mcp; rg -n 'func RawHistoryGit|func gitCommandContext|func runDoctor|fixable|doctorFixRegistry' pose-mcp/internal/pose/git* pose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go; rg -n 'doctor|commit.graph' .pose/knowledge --glob '*.md' | head -35; head -8 /var/tmp/closeout/ac-dc.out; head -8 /var/tmp/closeout/sc-dc.out; rg -n 'doctor-recommends|\\\"status\\\"|\\\"passed\\\"' .pose/results/delivery-validation.json | head -15\"","aggregated_output":"# POSE trail — review\n\nAvaliação técnica de PR/diff: escopo, contratos, segurança, validação.\n- Path:      pose-mcp → domain: backend-go (repo-map)\n- Workflow:  .pose/workflows/review.md\n- Skill:     pose-review\n- Rules:     .pose/rules/security.md, .pose/rules/documentation-style.md, .pose/rules/backend-go.md\n- Spec:      false\n- ADR:       false\n- Knowledge: consume=true, produce=handoff (quando aceitar risco residual ou condicionar merge)\n- Validation: exigir evidência de pose validate do implementador\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:39://   - \"fixable\": pose itself can apply a confined, reversible fix via\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:47:\tremediationFixable    = \"fixable\"\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:74:var doctorFixRegistry = map[string]doctorFix{\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:119:\tif _, ok := doctorFixRegistry[check]; ok {\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:183:\t\tif _, ok := doctorFixRegistry[only]; !ok {\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:184:\t\t\tfmt.Fprintf(stderr, text(\"Error: %q is not a fixable check code (available: %s)\\n\", \"Erro: %q não é um código de check corrigível (disponíveis: %s)\\n\"), only, strings.Join(fixableCodes(), \", \"))\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:211:func fixableCodes() []string {\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:212:\tcodes := make([]string, 0, len(doctorFixRegistry))\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:213:\tfor c := range doctorFixRegistry {\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:221:func runDoctorDiagnostics(locale cliLocale) (root string, findings []doctorFinding) {\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:1406:\t\t\tsuffix = cliText(locale, \" (fixable: pose doctor --fix)\", \" (corrigível: pose doctor --fix)\")\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:1449:// diagnostics, then list what each fixable finding *would* do — no\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:1455:\t\tplanned = append(planned, doctorFixCandidate{c, doctorFixRegistry[c].describe})\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:1475:\t\t\tfmt.Fprintln(stdout, cliText(locale, \"\\nfix: nothing fixable right now.\", \"\\nfix: nada corrigível no momento.\"))\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:1517:\t\t\tfmt.Fprintln(stdout, cliText(locale, \"\\nfix: nothing fixable right now.\", \"\\nfix: nada corrigível no momento.\"))\npose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor.go:1524:\t\tif err := doctorFixRegistry[c].apply(root); err != nil {\npose-mcp/internal/pose/git_snapshot_integrity.go:617:func gitCommandContext(ctx context.Context, args ...string) *exec.Cmd {\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-07-19-handoff-contract-baseline-handoff.md:53:`pose-doctor-guided-remediation` — findings de `pose doctor` ganharam\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-07-19-handoff-contract-baseline-handoff.md:55:blocked), versionado aditivamente via `doctor_schema_version` (JSON prévio\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-07-19-handoff-contract-baseline-handoff.md:56:intacto); `pose doctor --fix` prevê reparos confinados e reversíveis\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-07-19-handoff-contract-baseline-handoff.md:60:`2026-07-19-doctor-guided-remediation-confined-fix-registry.md`. (2)\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-07-19-handoff-contract-baseline-handoff.md:211:  Windows zip, placeholders removidos, E2E clean-host com doctor+check\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-07-19-handoff-contract-baseline-handoff.md:282:  `.pose/specs/pose-doctor-guided-remediation/`, `.pose/specs/pose-brownfield-reference-kits/`,\n.pose/knowledge/archive/2026-07-19-handoff-contr